        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2009 America East Conference Baseball Tournament\n- Teams: Binghamton Bearcats baseball, Albany Great Danes baseball\n- Organizations: University at Albany\n- People: Jon Mueller\n- Roles: college baseball head coach\n- Places: Albany, New York, United States\n\nFacts:\n- Jon Mueller was born on January 26, 1970.\n- Jon Mueller is an American college baseball coach.\n- Jon Mueller has been the head coach of Albany since the start of the 2000 season.\n- The Albany Great Danes baseball team is the varsity intercollegiate athletic team of the University at Albany in Albany, New York, United States.\n- In the championship game of the 2009 America East Conference Baseball Tournament, first-seeded Binghamton defeated second-seeded Albany 16-6.\n- Binghamton won its first tournament championship with the 16-6 victory over Albany in the 2009 America East Conference Baseball Tournament championship game.",
